# 0.1.18, Grab moves: Stun when dropped. The Swingshot in the right hand (QUEST_SIM_GIVE=12 QUEST_SIM_HOLD=12), a Novalis
# critter 6 units ahead (QUEST_SIM_NEAR=577 QUEST_SIM_NEAR_AT=6,0, --level 1). Caught and reeled in, the trigger let go with the
# hand still: "[vr-grab] dropped", then "dropped: stunned for 1.5 s" as it lands, about two units before the hand. The right
# grip takes the wrench, a step in and a sweep of the hand across, a second step in and two more sweeps, 18 ticks and more
# apart: two critters stand a unit apart there, the other one comes at him, and one sweep and a single step hit only that
# one (the stunned one's stun then wore off: "the stun wore off"). The hit on the stunned one: "[vr-wrench] hit slot N" with
# N the slot of "the hook out to slot N", then "[vr-grab] slot N let go: a hit on it (record R): the game's to take" and
# "[vr-hit] slot N after the hit". With 'QUEST_VR_OPTIONS=grab_stun 0' it lands and is let go at once ("it met the world").
